// D-REPORT-HOME1=A: typed diagnostic rows. The foundation registry reads this
// compile-time source and every renderer consumes the resulting rows.
// Fields are tab-separated: kind, code, stage, severity, moment, status,
// meaning, what, why, fix, detail, structured-fix, lint-name. The final field
// is required on lint rows and absent on error rows.
// Field 11 is `-`, a structured-fix marker, or `reason:<kind>|<next action>` for rows without machine edits.
